most of the features and capabilities of GeN-Foam.

NB: The introcution of the 2-phase capabilities in GeN-Foam comes with
 significant differences compared to the previous verions. In particular:

-	the U field now represents the REAL fluid velocity, not the superficial
	one! Be mindful of this when setting boundary conditions

-	the volumeFraction keyword to be specified in the phasePropertiesDict
	(i.e. the dict that substitues porousMediumProperties and fuelProperties)
	represents the volume fraction of the porous structure and is the 
	opposite of what was previously known as voidFraction, i.e.
	volumeFraction = 1 - voidFraction
	
